00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:14,680
That brat Noah can't intimidate me
with cheap virtual illusions like this.

252
00:15:14,980 --> 00:15:20,180
I rode better virtual reality programs back
when this kid was still wearing diapers.

253
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:22,180
This stuff's amateur.

254
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:26,480
You're right. Kaiba?

255
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:29,397
Did you just change your
outfit or something?

256
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:31,460
Uh, that's not Kaiba.

257
00:15:33,760 --> 00:15:34,590
Whoa!

258
00:15:34,673 --> 00:15:36,757
You, he, but I...

259
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:39,040
Relax, it's a cheap copy.

260
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:43,656
I used to create virtual clones of
myself all the time to duel against.

261
00:15:43,980 --> 00:15:46,740
Why duel yourself? Who better?

262
00:15:54,100 --> 00:15:55,480
Where'd he come from?

263
00:15:56,540 --> 00:15:57,580
Attention, fools.

264
00:15:57,980 --> 00:16:00,957
It's time for us to demonstrate
the new dueling rules.

265
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:02,687
What do you mean, new rules?

266
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:07,120
We've created a new system of dueling,
especially for our tournament.

267
00:16:07,380 --> 00:16:10,080
So pay attention and try to keep up.

268
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:17,660
In our world, we play by a new set of
rules called the Deckmaster System.

269
00:16:17,880 --> 00:16:22,917
So watch and learn as our virtual
Kaiba battles total defense show them.

270
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:26,580
First, each duelist must
choose a Deckmaster.

271
00:16:26,940 --> 00:16:29,240
Blue Eyes will be Virtual Kaibas.

272
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:33,180
Total Defense Shogun will act as
his own Deckmaster. Now, begin.

273
00:16:33,580 --> 00:16:37,120
For my first move, I
summon Lord of Dragons.

274
00:16:41,920 --> 00:16:45,880
And next, I activate the
Flute of Summoning Dragon.

275
00:16:50,380 --> 00:16:51,210
him.

276
00:16:51,293 --> 00:16:56,140
This magic card allows me to summon two
more Blue-Eyes White Dragons to the playing

277
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:01,830
field.

278
00:17:01,913 --> 00:17:06,897
And now I'll move my Deck Master
to the center of the playing field.

279
00:17:06,980 --> 00:17:09,940
Saiba Kaiba played three
Blue-Eyes in one move.

280
00:17:10,260 --> 00:17:13,317
So it looks like your
Deck Master stands next to

281
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:16,137
you until you decide to
summon it to the field.

282
00:17:16,220 --> 00:17:21,920
Lastly, I'll use Polymerization to fuse
my three Blue-Eyes White Dragons together.

283
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:29,100
To form Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon.

284
00:17:32,980 --> 00:17:34,660
As you can see,

285
00:17:35,020 --> 00:17:38,337
Virtual Kaiba combined his
Deckmaster with two other

286
00:17:38,420 --> 00:17:41,837
Blue-Eyes to form a creature
that's virtually unstoppable.

287
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:45,200
And thanks to his
Deckmaster Special Ability,

288
00:17:45,460 --> 00:17:48,225
this new Fusion Monster
can attack immediately!

289
00:17:48,860 --> 00:17:53,780
Blue Eyes Ultimate Dragon, I command you
to attack Total Defense Shogun directly!

290
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:03,700
Of course,

291
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:09,160
since Total Defense Shogun is also a
Deckmaster, it has its own Special Ability,

292
00:18:09,520 --> 00:18:11,140
Total Defense Barrier!

293
00:18:16,380 --> 00:18:20,260
It blocks the attack, and
reflects it right back!

294
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:30,680
Ta-ta, Virtual Kaibar!

295
00:18:30,900 --> 00:18:33,420
Soon that will happen to the real McCord!

296
00:18:33,700 --> 00:18:36,460
You see, if your Deckmaster is destroyed,

297
00:18:36,700 --> 00:18:40,657
you automatically lose the
duel regardless of life points!

298
00:18:40,740 --> 00:18:45,660
And when each of you loses a duel,
one of us will take over your body.

299
00:18:45,860 --> 00:18:46,960
I've heard enough.

300
00:18:47,440 --> 00:18:50,877
I've defeated you five
white-collar has-beens once before,

301
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:52,700
and I can easily do it again.

302
00:18:53,020 --> 00:18:56,520
No matter what the rules are,
I'll still take you down.

303
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:01,887
Let us out of here, you
crotchety old pranks.

304
00:19:02,300 --> 00:19:05,597
We've never even left
this room, you fools.

305
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:11,040
But make no mistake, you kids aren't
going anywhere for a long while.

306
00:19:12,060 --> 00:19:13,180
You're trapped,

307
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:17,437
and your only chance of escape is to
defeat each of us in a virtual duel.

308
00:19:17,520 --> 00:19:21,437
There's no way you're going to get
away with this, you stuffed shirts!

309
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:22,350
Yeah!

310
00:19:22,433 --> 00:19:24,880
We'll kick your big
business butts! Joey, wait!

311
00:19:25,800 --> 00:19:27,320
Don't worry, Serenity.

312
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:30,285
We can whip these five
geezers one, two, three.

313
00:19:30,460 --> 00:19:33,657
I promise we'll win, and I've
never broken a promise to you.

314
00:19:33,740 --> 00:19:36,720
Then promise you'll be careful. Deal.

315
00:19:37,420 --> 00:19:40,480
If we stick together,
they won't stand a chance.

316
00:19:40,720 --> 00:19:43,540
Don't worry, I got your back, man. Me too.

317
00:19:44,120 --> 00:19:46,860
Pass the jam, because these guys are pups.

318
00:19:47,020 --> 00:19:47,880
Hold on, guys.

319
00:19:48,140 --> 00:19:51,375
They never said which of us
will actually have to duel.

320
00:19:52,780 --> 00:19:54,300
Good question, kid.

321
00:19:54,640 --> 00:19:57,560
Just to make sure that
you all suffer equally,

322
00:19:57,860 --> 00:20:00,477
we'll be dueling against
every one of you, brats.

323
00:20:00,560 --> 00:20:03,380
Remember, we need to
take over five bodies.

324
00:20:03,700 --> 00:20:06,397
So the first five of you
to lose will have the honor

325
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:09,560
of gaining our minds while
yours stay trapped here.

326
00:20:10,500 --> 00:20:11,960
In your dreams!

327
00:20:12,260 --> 00:20:17,360
Ever since you destroyed our bodies,
all we've had are our dreams, Mr. Kaiba.

328
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:18,940
Until now.

329
00:20:19,360 --> 00:20:23,937
The time has come to make our dreams
a reality by escaping from this

330
00:20:24,020 --> 00:20:28,500
virtual abyss and leaving you here
in our place for all eternity.
